### Example API requests for the Billing Management System (port 8081).
### Run each with the green arrow in IntelliJ's HTTP Client. Replace IDs with real ones.

### Health check
GET http://localhost:8081/api/health

### Create a customer (status becomes ACTIVE automatically)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Himalayan Traders Pvt. Ltd.",
  "email": "accounts@himalayantraders.com.np",
  "phone": "+977 1 4412345",
  "address": "New Road, Kathmandu",
  "panNumber": "601234567",
  "customerType": "BUSINESS",
  "notes": "Pays by bank transfer"
}

### Create a draft invoice (totals and 13% VAT are calculated by the server)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/invoices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "REPLACE_WITH_CUSTOMER_ID",
  "issueDate": "2026-10-16",
  "dueDate": "2026-10-31",
  "items": [
    { "description": "Website design", "quantity": 2, "unitPrice": 1500 },
    { "description": "Domain and hosting (1 year)", "quantity": 1, "unitPrice": 999.99 }
  ],
  "discountAmount": 100,
  "notes": "Thank you for your business"
}

### Issue the invoice (assigns INV-2026-0001 and locks it)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/invoices/REPLACE_WITH_INVOICE_ID/issue

### Record a payment
POST http://localhost:8081/api/invoices/REPLACE_WITH_INVOICE_ID/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 1000,
  "paymentDate": "2026-10-16",
  "method": "ESEWA",
  "reference": "ESW-20261016-001"
}

### Payments of an invoice
GET http://localhost:8081/api/invoices/REPLACE_WITH_INVOICE_ID/payments

### Overdue invoices
GET http://localhost:8081/api/invoices/overdue

### Invoices filtered
GET http://localhost:8081/api/invoices?status=PARTIALLY_PAID&customerId=REPLACE_WITH_CUSTOMER_ID

### Cancel an unpaid invoice
POST http://localhost:8081/api/invoices/REPLACE_WITH_INVOICE_ID/cancel

### Payments filtered by method and date range
GET http://localhost:8081/api/payments?method=ESEWA&from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-31

### Customer account summary
GET http://localhost:8081/api/customers/REPLACE_WITH_CUSTOMER_ID/summary

### Dashboard
GET http://localhost:8081/api/dashboard/summary
